2. THE FAMILY DATA — the genealogical content, including site/data/tree.json
   and anything derived from the family's records.

Not licensed for reuse. It is one family's personal record, published here in
a deliberately reduced form so that relatives can read it. It is not a dataset.

Please do not scrape it, republish it, or ingest it into a genealogy service,
a training corpus, or any other aggregation. If you are related and want a
copy, ask — that is a much better route than copying this one.
